###  Probar ruta raíz
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Miguel",
  "last_name": "Díaz",
  "email": "miguel@test.com",
  "age": 30,
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "miguel@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

